            "text": "Cross-tenant IDOR on all knowledge-base routes (read/write/delete of other organizations' KBs and files)\n\nAll knowledge-base management routes (`/api/knowledge-bases/*`) perform authentication but no organization-scoping on object lookups. `knowledgeBaseService` queries Prisma by bare record ID, so an authenticated user from any organization can read, modify, and delete another organization's knowledge bases, folders, and uploaded files."
