            "text": "Cross-tenant IDOR on briefing routes (read/mark-read/archive other organizations' scope briefings)\n\nBriefing routes under `/api/business-scopes/:scopeId/briefings` filter only by `business_scope_id` and never by organization or caller membership. Any authenticated user can read another organization's scope briefings (titles, summaries, importance, agent identity) and mark them read or archive them."
