                "description": "1. Upload a skill whose skill.zip contains a member named `../../../../../tmp/marker-zipslip.txt` (stored to S3 via the normal skill upload path). 2. Ensure the extraction path takes the python3 fallback (unzip unavailable/failing on the host). 3. Start a session that provisions the skill — extractSkillZip writes the member outside the skill dir.",
                "script_available": true
